    },
    "body": "The previous next action still called for the last matched fit and trained-export capacity audit. All six fits and the all-row audit are complete, and categorical H4 Context credit has landed in #1837.\n\nUpdate current state with the six-arm results, independent artifact receipts, frozen-state/energy boundaries and actual full-bank zero-update CUDA checks. Replace the stale next action with a shared-legal-parameter native-loss direction packet followed by a matched joint Context/Potential/Generate comparison. Update the canonical plan to reflect that causal successor while retaining the geometric-chat and native-serving obligations.\n\nDocumentation only. Exact-head `git diff --check` and `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` passed. Independent evidence review matched the six-arm table, hashes and categorical condition counts to authenticated receipts; its route-record versus distinct-vector wording correction is applied. No Rust change or new model run is included.\n\nReferences #820.\n",
