      "body": "Exact-head documentation self-review at `b3c7a21da9009c95c90f65414dfe0638613a1d7d`, direct main base `e2f9ede073c8200b4471c63b777e170d72032db7`.\n\n`git diff --check` and `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` both passed at this source. Independent evidence review READY at this exact head: six-arm counts, artifact hashes, paired gain/loss scopes and categorical parity counts agree with authenticated audits. The requested correction distinguishes8720 route/control records from numerically distinct vectors. Teacher-prefix gains remain separate from zero own-prefix results; fixed-export exclusions do not become geometric-family impossibility; zero-update gradients do not become a language claim. Next action changes the causal intervention and keeps full native export/reload and laterCopy retention.\n\nDocumentation only, two files24+/1-. No Rust build/test rerun is necessary for these text-only changes. #1837's actual CPU/CUDA checks and fullbank audit are recorded with their exact source/harness identities, not attributed to this docs commit. Ready for protected queue.\n",
